1
00:00:01,840 --> 00:00:10,161
No words, no noise - it all aligned,

2
00:00:10,241 --> 00:00:20,302
Where storms once lived, there’s peace of mind.

3
00:00:20,442 --> 00:00:25,342
I stand here breathing, real and whole,

4
00:00:25,362 --> 00:00:27,202
Among simple things - that’s the goal.

5
00:00:27,222 --> 00:00:29,863
I didn’t shout when the lights went low,

6
00:00:29,923 --> 00:00:31,883
I kept moving forward - found a window.

7
00:00:31,983 --> 00:00:34,163
Through the glass, the daylight came,

8
00:00:34,183 --> 00:00:36,383
Every step now answers my name.

9
00:00:36,403 --> 00:00:38,363
Life with no witnesses, no applause,

10
00:00:38,383 --> 00:00:40,584
Just quiet flavor of where I was.

11
00:00:40,624 --> 00:00:42,364
Every “hold on” wasn’t about pain,

12
00:00:42,424 --> 00:00:45,884
It was shaping the road, defining the frame.

13
00:00:46,004 --> 00:00:53,905
The backbone of silent choices - my light,

14
00:00:53,965 --> 00:01:01,485
It holds me steady through the longest nights.

15
00:01:01,525 --> 00:01:07,226
No words, no noise, no empty phrases,

16
00:01:07,526 --> 00:01:16,907
That backbone became the strength that raises.

17
00:01:17,047 --> 00:01:19,387
I don’t wait around for miracles now,

18
00:01:19,547 --> 00:01:21,427
I became one slowly - step by step somehow.

19
00:01:21,447 --> 00:01:23,187
Thousands of days just living straight,

20
00:01:23,207 --> 00:01:25,928
Then you notice - you’re growing in place.

21
00:01:25,948 --> 00:01:27,948
Every refusal, every “one more try”

22
00:01:28,028 --> 00:01:29,568
Built my foundation, not my why.

23
00:01:29,608 --> 00:01:31,748
Quiet inside, calm in my chest,

24
00:01:31,768 --> 00:01:33,848
I know the direction - forward’s best.

25
00:01:33,968 --> 00:01:36,068
The backbone of silent choices - my light,

26
00:01:36,128 --> 00:01:46,069
It holds me steady through the longest nights.

27
00:01:46,089 --> 00:01:53,910
No words, no noise, no empty phrases,

28
00:01:54,150 --> 00:02:17,592
That backbone became the strength that raises.

29
00:02:17,692 --> 00:02:18,532
O-o-o-o-o...

30
00:02:18,552 --> 00:02:21,632
...strength that raises...

31
00:02:21,652 --> 00:02:26,893
I don’t argue now, don’t need to prove,

32
00:02:26,913 --> 00:02:29,913
I act, I build, I quietly move.

33
00:02:29,953 --> 00:02:35,874
Everything needed is already here,

34
00:02:35,894 --> 00:02:41,954
Life keeps burning - clean and clear.

35
00:02:42,054 --> 00:02:45,115
No loud ideas, no need to pretend,

36
00:02:45,135 --> 00:02:50,075
I got quieter - but stronger in the end.

37
00:02:50,175 --> 00:02:54,035
Let the world keep shifting its light,

38
00:02:54,095 --> 00:02:55,735
Inside me now - a steady bright.

39
00:02:55,795 --> 00:02:59,036
O-o-o-o-o...Inside me now...

40
00:02:59,136 --> 00:03:00,376
...steady bright...

